From 257f6cde15815733367a2511418268dd409e5b0e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:24:38 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Add double doors (hinge state) and cap texture support

- New "hinge" (left/right) door property: 32 door states. The open slab
  swings to the hinge side; right-hinged fronts are mirrored.
- Placing a door beside a left-hinged door of the same facing makes the new
  one right-hinged (matching its open state), forming a double door.
- Right-clicking either door of a pair toggles both.
- Door top/bottom faces use an optional "cap" texture key (falls back to the
  edge texture until the PNG is added).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01L3RoKZqiDdp3wpP3VHcmMS
---
 BlockInteraction.cs                     | 60 ++++++++++++++++++++++---
 BlockRegistry.cs                        | 18 ++++++--
 BlockShapes.cs                          | 16 ++++---
 ChunkMesher.cs                          | 15 ++++---
 CuboidFever.Tests/BlockShapesTests.cs   | 57 ++++++++++++++++++-----
 data/cuboidfever/block/wooden_door.json |  3 +-
 6 files changed, 138 insertions(+), 31 deletions(-)

